      "fontFamily": 3,
      "text": "AUTO CAMERA\nShort loop: fit route + rider\nwhen readable.\nLong segment: follow rider +\nroute ahead; cap zoom-out.\nFit route: full overview.\nFollow me: restore auto camera.\nPan/zoom: manual until Follow me.\nAnalysis: fit selected route.\nMissing tiles: keep route / rider\noverlays + unavailable status.",
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
