      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "text": "SUPPORTING STATES\nSensor sheet: scan / connect HR.\nNo HR needed to start riding.\nNo known match: ordinary stats.\nWeak GPS: show uncertainty.\nInterrupted ride: resume with gap\nor finish saved recording.\nNative recording owns persistence.",
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "supportingnotes",
      "originalText": "SUPPORTING STATES\nSensor sheet: scan / connect HR.\nNo HR needed to start riding.\nNo known match: ordinary stats.\nWeak GPS: show uncertainty.\nInterrupted ride: resume with gap\nor finish saved recording.\nNative recording owns persistence.",
